note functions, recursion, closures, auto-call
to add with a and b
    give back a + b
show add with 3 and 4
to fact with n
    if n is at most 1 then
        give back 1
    give back n * fact with n - 1
show fact with 6
to greet
    give back "hi there"
show greet
to make_adder with x
    to adder with y
        give back x + y
    give back adder
add5 is make_adder with 5
show add5 with 10
counter is 0
to bump
    counter is counter + 1
bump
bump
show counter
to outer
    v is "outer v"
    to inner
        give back v
    show inner
outer
